      "expectation": "Review per tablist when the document has no tabpanel at all: the tab list probably is\nnavigation dressed up as tabs, or the panels lack their role. ARIA only describes the panel as\nusual, so never a violation. Any tabpanel in the document passes. Hidden subtrees are out of scope.",
